Z||000010||theogre||02-07-2000||08:15 PM||||Actually I live in upper delaware. I've been talking with Cliff since nearly day one of the forum going online. I think it was only up a couple months at that point.<P>Actually my Fiero pages are hosted by Cliff. I wanted to write for the car, but didn't want to create yet another site with 5 pages on it. You only go to my own site on sprynet/mindspring if you escape tunnel 6 to my main cavern.<P>Along with the mirror project currently underway, I'll probably be taking some of our really common questions and moving them to sort of a FAQ. That part will be a combination of both my own writings and excerpts from, and links to, various threads. Just where an FAQ will end up on the site I don't know. I do know we've gotten to a point where we are repeating allot of things several times, it gets a little tiresome at times. I'm happy to help but none of us want to type the same things 50 times. probably put some of the most common links there to. ||||reg||1
