Z||000012||2birds||02-08-2000||10:12 PM||||Of all the places I went when I was on an attack sub, the Netherlands was probably the best.  Really nice people, beautiful countryside, interesting architecture in Rotterdam, and those "specialty" shops in Amsterdam were wild, too (Van Halen summed it up well in song).  Nicest of all the liberty ports I saw in Europe and the Middle East.  Excellent beer, too.||||reg||1
